        <div class="ch-body"><span class="ch-yr">2024–2026</span><h3>The comeback</h3><p>The team grew well beyond the dozen students who restarted it and rebuilt its design process, training, and team structure. Our student-run summer camp raised $6,000, and in 2026 we competed in the new California district for the first time, finishing the season at the Southern State Championship.</p><ul class="badges" aria-label="Awards and milestones"><li class="wbadge"><span class="wing wing-l" aria-hidden="true"><svg><use href="#wing"/></svg></span><span>State Championship 2026</span><span class="wing wing-r" aria-hidden="true"><svg><use href="#wing"/></svg></span></li></ul><a class="ch-link" href="/resources/media#socal-showdown-2025">See photos →</a></div>
      </article>
      <article class="chapter flip rv">
        <span class="ch-node" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <div class="ch-photo">
          <figure class="ch-main photo-card"><div class="pc-in"><img src="/gal/oc-regional-2022/07.webp" alt="Team members in masks posing in the pits in 2022" loading="lazy"></div></figure>
          <figure class="ch-second"><span class="tape" aria-hidden="true"></span><img src="/gal/beach-blitz-2022/09.webp" alt="The team celebrating together after Beach Blitz 2022" loading="lazy"></figure>
          <p class="ch-cap">OC Regional · 2022</p>
        </div>
        <div class="ch-body"><span class="ch-yr">2020–2023</span><h3>The reset</h3><p>COVID-19 broke the team's momentum, and 6220 regrouped from a small core of students. That crew earned the Against All Odds Award at Beach Blitz 2022 and the Finalist Award at the 2023 Orange County Regional.</p><ul class="badges" aria-label="Awards and milestones"><li class="wbadge"><span class="wing wing-l" aria-hidden="true"><svg><use href="#wing"/></svg></span><span>Against All Odds 2022</span><span class="wing wing-r" aria-hidden="true"><svg><use href="#wing"/></svg></span></li><li class="wbadge"><span class="wing wing-l" aria-hidden="true"><svg><use href="#wing"/></svg></span><span>Finalist 2023</span><span class="wing wing-r" aria-hidden="true"><svg><use href="#wing"/></svg></span></li></ul><a class="ch-link" href="/resources/media#oc-regional-2022">See photos →</a></div>
      </article>
      <article class="chapter rv">
        <span class="ch-node" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <div class="ch-photo">
          <figure class="ch-main photo-card tl-l"><div class="pc-in"><img src="/gal/power-up-2018/01.webp" alt="The 2018 team photo in the school parking lot" loading="lazy"></div></figure>
          <figure class="ch-second is-render"><span class="tape" aria-hidden="true"></span><img src="/assets/main/fc1361c0d9.webp" alt="CAD render of the 2019 robot" loading="lazy"></figure>
          <p class="ch-cap">The 2018 team · 2019 robot</p>
        </div>
        <div class="ch-body"><span class="ch-yr">2017–2019</span><h3>The climb</h3><p>The team kept competing at the Orange County Regional every year, and added Beach Blitz in 2018 and 2019, where we were named an Alliance Captain in 2018.</p><ul class="badges" aria-label="Awards and milestones"><li class="wbadge"><span class="wing wing-l" aria-hidden="true"><svg><use href="#wing"/></svg></span><span>Alliance Captain 2018</span><span class="wing wing-r" aria-hidden="true"><svg><use href="#wing"/></svg></span></li></ul><a class="ch-link" href="/resources/media#power-up-2018">See photos →</a></div>
      </article>
