          <p class="ch-cap">OC Regional Winner · 2016</p>
        </div>
        <div class="ch-body"><span class="ch-yr">2016</span><h3>Founding</h3><p>A small group of Los Alamitos High School students started the team out of the Build-It Workspace. In our rookie season we won the Orange County Regional and earned a spot at the FIRST World Championship.</p><ul class="badges" aria-label="Awards and milestones"><li class="wbadge"><span class="wing wing-l" aria-hidden="true"><svg><use href="#wing"/></svg></span><span>Regional Winner</span><span class="wing wing-r" aria-hidden="true"><svg><use href="#wing"/></svg></span></li><li class="wbadge"><span class="wing wing-l" aria-hidden="true"><svg><use href="#wing"/></svg></span><span>World Championship</span><span class="wing wing-r" aria-hidden="true"><svg><use href="#wing"/></svg></span></li></ul><a class="ch-link" href="/resources/media#stronghold-2016">See photos →</a></div>
